{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43964","headline":"书桐叶 · 任氏","name":"书桐叶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拭翠敛蛾眉，郁郁心中事。\n搦管下庭除，书成相思字。\n此字不书石，此字不书纸。\n书在桐叶上，愿逐秋风起。\n天下有心人，尽解相思死。\n天下负心人，不识相思字。\n有心与负心，不知落何地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}